q 0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 736 Td (1. INTRODUCTION) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 718 Td (Database Management Systems \(DBMS\) form the computational bedrock of global aviation and transportation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 704.5 Td (enterprises. An airline reservation and flight operations network is, fundamentally, a highly intricate web of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 691.0 Td (interdependent entities - airport hubs, airframes, cabin physical topologies, flight schedules, customer identities,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 677.5 Td (reservation transactions, electronic tickets, departure check-in manifests, baggage handling custody, and financial) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 664.0 Td (ledgers - whose relational integrity must be maintained with zero margin for error.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 646.5 Td (In a commercial airline network, thousands of passengers interact with seat maps, flight departures, and baggage) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 633.0 Td (desks simultaneously. Coordinating which passenger occupies which seat on which flight leg, ensuring that baggage) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 619.5 Td (weight allowances are reconciled accurately, tracking flight departure statuses across multiple airport terminals, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 606.0 Td (managing transaction refunds requires a robust, ACID-compliant database architecture.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 588.5 Td (Manually maintained records, physical registers, or disconnected flat spreadsheets suffer from fatal concurrency flaws,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 575.0 Td (data duplication, lack of referential enforcement, and update anomalies. A relational database system, in contrast, is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 561.5 Td (designed specifically to maintain structured, normalized records, enforcing domain and foreign key integrity constraints) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 548.0 Td (at the database engine level.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 530.5 Td (This project presents the complete design and implementation of the Airline Reservation & Flight Operations) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 517.0 Td (Management System \(ARFOM-DB\). The database is structured across twelve fully normalized relational tables) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 503.5 Td (capturing airports, aircraft fleet, seat configurations, routes, flights, passengers, bookings, tickets, payments, airport) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 490.0 Td (check-ins, baggage weight records, and cancellation penalties.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 472.5 Td (An ANSI-standard relational engine \(SQLite 3.x / MySQL 8.0\) serves as the persistent data storage layer, while a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 459.0 Td (responsive, high-contrast web operations application built with vanilla HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, paired with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 445.5 Td (Python REST server, enables administrative dispatchers and passengers to execute real-time flight bookings,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 432.0 Td (interactive cabin seat allocation, live airport radar tracking, and baggage check-in without requiring direct SQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 418.5 Td (command-line knowledge.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 401.0 Td (The operational flight routes, airport hubs, and schedules modelled in this project reference authentic global aviation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 387.5 Td (corridors \(such as New Delhi DEL, Mumbai BOM, Dubai DXB, London Heathrow LHR, and Singapore SIN\) to establish) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 374.0 Td (industrial realism. The overarching motivation is academic - applying advanced relational modelling, Boyce-Codd / 3NF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 360.5 Td (normalization, constraint defense engineering, and full-stack database integration concepts to a mission-critical) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 347.0 Td (domain.) Tj ET
Q
q
