q 0.1 0.2 0.4 rg
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 736 Td (3. OBJECTIVES AND SCOPE) Tj ET
Q
q 0.1 0.15 0.25 rg
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 54 708 Td (3.1 Objectives) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 693 Td (1. Design a comprehensive, fully normalized 3NF relational schema for airline reservation and flight operations.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 676.5 Td (2. Store and organize airport hubs, aircraft fleets, cabin seat maps, routes, and flight schedules systematically.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 660.0 Td (3. Manage passenger profiles, commercial bookings, 6-character PNR references, and electronic ticket issuance.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 643.5 Td (4. Enforce engine-level entity, referential, domain, and unique constraints \(e.g. composite uniqueness on flight_id + seat_id\).) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 627.0 Td (5. Implement airport departure control workflows: passenger check-in processing and automated excess luggage calculation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 614.5 Td (\(>15 kg allowance\).) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 598.0 Td (6. Manage financial payment records and cancellation penalty/refund ledgers with ACID transaction integrity.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 581.5 Td (7. Develop a responsive, modern web interface connected to the relational database using Python REST backend APIs.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 565.0 Td (8. Implement multi-column search, filtering, and pagination across all database entities and master operational manifests.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 548.5 Td (9. Implement interactive aircraft cabin seat allocation \(First, Business, Economy\) with visual occupancy feedback.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 532.0 Td (10. Provide an airport Flight Information Display System \(FIDS\) radar board for tracking real-time departures and arrivals.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 515.5 Td (11. Validate database performance and data consistency through representative multi-table analytical SQL queries.) Tj ET
Q
q 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 499.0 Td (12. Perform comprehensive testing including live CRUD verification, negative testing, and constraint violation rejection.) Tj ET
