BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 528.5 Td (The schema was decomposed following mathematical normalization principles to eliminate redundancy and prevent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 515.0 Td (update/delete anomalies:) Tj ET
